cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in scientific work, please cite the repository using these metadata."
title: "Battery Health Dashboard"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Chair of Electrical Energy Storage Technology, Technical University of Munich"
abstract: >-
  Battery health monitoring and lifetime prediction dashboard developed in the
  context of the HealthBatt research project. The software combines an
  operational traffic-light monitoring system with analysis of capacity and
  resistance trends, GEIS/DRT measurements, degradation mode analysis and
  battery lifetime prediction.
license: BSD-3-Clause
keywords:
  - battery health
  - battery monitoring
  - state of health
  - lifetime prediction
  - electrochemical impedance spectroscopy
  - distribution of relaxation times
  - degradation mode analysis
  - HealthBatt
